cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OVF Predictor"
abstract: >-
  Explainable machine-learning calculator estimating the probability of an
  unfavourable clinico-radiological outcome at three months in thoracolumbar
  osteoporotic vertebral fractures, with a within-model counterfactual contrast
  for vertebral cementation. Research prototype; not a medical device.
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
license: MIT
url: "https://ovf-predictor.vercel.app/"

# Sustituir por la URL real del repositorio y descomentar antes de publicar:
# repository-code: "https://github.com/<usuario>/ovf-predictor"

authors:
  - family-names: "Martínez-Núñez"
    given-names: "Pablo"
  - family-names: "Gutiérrez-González"
    given-names: "Raquel"

keywords:
  - osteoporotic vertebral fracture
  - thoracolumbar spine
  - vertebral augmentation
  - clinical prediction model
  - logistic regression
  - explainable machine learning
  - SHAP
  - clinical decision support
